  "originalText": "[Code Name] Astgenne\n[Gender] Female\n[Combat Experience] None\n[Place of Birth] Columbia\n[Date of Birth] Jul 10\n[Race] Liberi\n[Height] 166cm\n[Infection Status]\nConfirmed Infected by medical examination.",
