  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Rhine Lab Energy Section Researcher Dr. Elena Urbica. While aboard Rhodes Island, she will use her original name as her codename.\nWhile she is more than capable of keeping her enemies at bay with her handmade staff and unique Originium Arts, rather than fighting on the frontlines, she prefers to provide support from the rear by working on research and machinery maintenance."
